# Patterns here are relative to experiments/. The 10 measured speculative logs are ~1 MB
# each: llama-cli's -v flag makes it print the internal server's full request JSON, so those
# two cells alone are 8.7 MB of runtime spam against a 630 KiB repository. They are ignored
# for size, not for content — regenerate any of them with the commands in REPORT.md §6, and
# every number they produced is stored in results/variant_speculative.json.
logs/*.log
!logs/speculative_*_qwen3-30b-a3b_run1.log
!logs/verify_*.log
!logs/baseline_*.log
!logs/flashattention_*.log
!logs/kv-cache-quant_*.log
!logs/evidence_*.log
